sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectImages
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UploadProjectImageBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UploadProjectImageController
  participant StorageService as «control»<br/>StorageService
  participant ProjectImage as «entity»<br/>ProjectImage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: upload photos to my IDP
  UI->>B: POST /api/designer/projects/{id}/images (JWT)
  B->>C: upload(Integer designerId, Integer projectId, MultipartFile file)
  alt 11th image or invalid file
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>StorageService: store()
  StorageService-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectImage: save()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C-->>B: ImageResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end